  m_sTitle "Overview"
  m_sTextData "A Russian Company (-) attempt to dislodge CDF Foreign Legion from a trench system on a drone saturated front line."\
  ""\
  "<h2>Notes</h2>"\
  "• 8 Respawns for CDF."
