 {
  coords 3332.707 24.656 3235.575
  m_sTitle "Mission Notes"
  m_sTextData "<h2>END CONDITIONS</h2>"\
  "<b>OPFOR VICTORY</b>"\
  "• Both the Trench System and Farm objectives are secured."\
  "OR"\
  "•90% of BLUFOR personnel are killed."\
  ""\
  "<b>BLUFOR VICTORY</b>"\
  "• BLUFOR retains control of the Trench System when the 60-minute time limit expires."\
  "OR"\
  "• 70% of OPFOR personnel are killed."\
  ""\
  "<h2>NOTES</h2>"\
  "• Time limit: 60 minutes."\
  "• Force ratio: 2.4:1 (OPFOR:BLUFOR)."\
  "• OPFOR Company HQ and BLUFOR Platoon Leader must be slotted. These roles are expected to lead their respective forces using the drone feed, at least until all respawns are in play."\
  "• Trench System capture timer: 2 minutes."\
  "• Farm capture timer: 5 minutes."\
  "• Objectives can be retaken."
  m_bEmptyFactionVisibility 1
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  m_iOrder 1
 }
}